<<<Section>>>
title: Evidence
subtitle: Observe and conclude
themeColor: #0EA5E9

<<<Lesson>>>
title: Observations and inferences

<<<Text markdown>>>
## See vs. conclude

Observation: "The leaves turned yellow." Inference: "The plant lacks light."
Record both, then test the inference.
<<<Text/>>>
